<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>La Chaussure — EMPREINTE</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,700;1,900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --noir: #0A0A0A; --blanc: #F5F2ED; --terre: #C47A3A; --vert: #2E5C3A; --gris: #888;
    }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--blanc); color: var(--noir); overflow-x: hidden; cursor: none; }
    .cursor { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--terre); border-radius: 50%; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); transition: width .2s,height .2s; }
    .cursor-ring { width: 36px; height: 36px; border: 1px solid rgba(196,122,58,.5); border-radius: 50%; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9998; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); transition: all .12s ease-out; }

    /* NAV */
    nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 40px; height: 64px; background: rgba(10,10,10,.92); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .nav-logo { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-center{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;}
    .nav-link{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(245,242,237,.5);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s;}
    .nav-link:hover,.nav-link.active{color:var(--blanc);}
    .nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;}
    .nav-icon{width:40px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:rgba(245,242,237,.6);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s;position:relative;}
    .nav-icon:hover{color:var(--blanc);}
    .cart-badge{background:var(--terre);color:#fff;border-radius:50%;width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;font-weight:900;position:absolute;top:5px;right:3px;}

    /* HERO */
    .hero { height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
    .hero-img { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?w=1800&q=85&fit=crop'); background-size: cover; background-position: center 30%; }
    .hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,10,10,.9) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,.2) 60%, transparent 100%); }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 0 64px 80px; width: 100%; }
    .hero-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terre); margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .hero-eyebrow::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--terre); }
    .hero h1 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(80px, 12vw, 160px); line-height: .88; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(245,242,237,.55); max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300; }

    /* TICKER */
    .ticker { background: var(--noir); overflow: hidden; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .ticker-track { display: flex; animation: ticker 24s linear infinite; width: max-content; }
    .ticker-item { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(245,242,237,.4); padding: 0 40px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .ticker-item span { color: var(--terre); margin-right: 40px; }
    @keyframes ticker { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

    /* INTRO */
    .intro { padding: 120px 64px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
    .intro-text .label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--vert); margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .intro-text h2 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(52px, 5vw, 72px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: .95; color: var(--noir); margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .intro-text h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .intro-text p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .intro-visual { position: relative; }
    .intro-visual img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .intro-visual-tag { position: absolute; bottom: 24px; left: 24px; background: var(--terre); color: var(--blanc); font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 10px 18px; }

    /* COMPOSANTS */
    .composants { background: var(--noir); padding: 120px 64px; }
    .composants-header { margin-bottom: 80px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; padding-bottom: 32px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; }
    .composants-header h2 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); line-height: .95; }
    .composants-header h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .composants-header p { font-size: 14px; color: #555; max-width: 280px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: right; }

    .compo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: #1a1a1a; }
    .compo { background: var(--noir); padding: 52px 40px; transition: background .3s; }
    .compo:hover { background: #0f0f0f; }
    .compo-icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: block; }
    .compo-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terre); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .compo-zone { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #444; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .compo-desc { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; }
    .compo-highlight { margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(46,92,58,.12); border-left: 2px solid var(--vert); font-size: 12px; color: #7ab58a; font-weight: 500; }

    /* SPLIT PHOTO */
    .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 75vh; }
    .split-photo { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
    .split-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform .7s ease; }
    .split:hover .split-photo img { transform: scale(1.04); }
    .split-content { padding: 80px 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
    .split-content.dark { background: var(--noir); }
    .split-content.light { background: var(--blanc); }
    .split-content .label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--vert); margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .split-content h3 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(44px, 4vw, 60px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: .95; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .split-content.dark h3 { color: var(--blanc); }
    .split-content.light h3 { color: var(--noir); }
    .split-content h3 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .split-content p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .split-content.dark p { color: #555; }
    .split-content.light p { color: #666; }
    .spec-list { margin-top: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
    .spec-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 0; font-size: 13px; }
    .split-content.dark .spec-row { border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .split-content.light .spec-row { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,10,10,.08); }
    .spec-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .spec-k { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; }
    .split-content.dark .spec-k { color: #444; }
    .split-content.light .spec-k { color: #aaa; }
    .spec-v { font-weight: 600; }
    .split-content.dark .spec-v { color: var(--blanc); }
    .split-content.light .spec-v { color: var(--noir); }

    /* MECANISME SLIDE-LOCK */
    .slidelock { padding: 120px 64px; background: var(--blanc); }
    .slidelock-header { margin-bottom: 72px; text-align: center; }
    .slidelock-header .label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--vert); margin-bottom: 20px; display: block; }
    .slidelock-header h2 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: .95; color: var(--noir); }
    .slidelock-header h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .slidelock-header p { font-size: 15px; color: #888; margin-top: 16px; max-width: 460px; margin-inline: auto; line-height: 1.7; }

    .steps-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(10,10,10,.1); }
    .step { background: var(--blanc); padding: 48px 32px; transition: background .3s; }
    .step:hover { background: #eeebe4; }
    .step-n { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 300; font-size: 64px; color: rgba(10,10,10,.06); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .step-title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--noir); margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .step-desc { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #888; }
    .step-clic { margin-top: 20px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--terre); }

    /* DURABILITE */
    .durabilite { background: var(--vert); padding: 80px 64px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; }
    .dur-item { padding: 48px 32px; border-right: 1px solid rgba(245,242,237,.1); }
    .dur-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .dur-n { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1; color: var(--blanc); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .dur-l { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: rgba(245,242,237,.5); }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-band { background: var(--noir); padding: 80px 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .cta-band h3 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); line-height: .95; }
    .cta-band h3 em { color: var(--terre); font-style: normal; }
    .btn-cta { display: inline-block; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; background: var(--terre); color: var(--blanc); padding: 16px 40px; transition: background .2s; white-space: nowrap; }
    .btn-cta:hover { background: #a8642e; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer { background: var(--noir); padding: 80px 64px 48px; border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .footer-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; margin-bottom: 64px; padding-bottom: 64px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .footer-logo { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-logo span { color: var(--terre); }
    .footer-tagline { font-size: 13px; color: #444; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 220px; }
    .footer-col h5 { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #444; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .footer-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .footer-col ul li a { font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
    .footer-col ul li a:hover { color: var(--blanc); }
    .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 11px; color: #333; letter-spacing: .06em; }
    .footer-socials { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
    .fsocial { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #444; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
    .fsocial:hover { color: var(--blanc); }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      nav { padding: 0 20px; }
      .nav-center .nav-link { display: none; }
      .hero-content { padding: 0 24px 56px; }
      .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 64px 24px; }
      .composants { padding: 80px 24px; }
      .compo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .split-photo { height: 50vh; }
      .steps-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .durabilite { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; padding: 48px 24px; }
      .slidelock { padding: 80px 24px; }
      .cta-band { flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; padding: 64px 24px; }
      footer { padding: 64px 24px 40px; }
      .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>
  <div class="cursor-ring" id="cursorRing"></div>

  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Empreinte</a>
    <div class="nav-center">
      <a href="/pages/chaussure" class="nav-link active">La Chaussure</a>
      <a href="/pages/semelles" class="nav-link">Les Semelles</a>
      <a href="/pages/technologie" class="nav-link">Technologie</a>
      <a href="/pages/commander" class="nav-link">Produits</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <a href="/pages/compte" class="nav-icon" title="Mon compte"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/></svg></a>
      <a href="/pages/commander" class="nav-icon" title="Panier"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 01-8 0"/></svg><span class="cart-badge" id="navBadge" style="display:none"></span></a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-img"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">La base — Conçue pour durer</div>
      <h1>La<br>chaussure.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Une base haute performance pensée pour ne jamais être en contact direct avec le sol. C'est son secret pour durer 3× plus longtemps.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TICKER -->
  <div class="ticker">
    <div class="ticker-track">
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Mesh Matryx Kevlar indéchirable</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Mousse PEBA haute résilience</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Système Slide-Lock™ breveté</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Joint Seal-Lip silicone périmétral</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> 1 500 km de durée de vie garantie</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Mesh Matryx Kevlar indéchirable</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Mousse PEBA haute résilience</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Système Slide-Lock™ breveté</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Joint Seal-Lip silicone périmétral</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> 1 500 km de durée de vie garantie</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="intro-text">
      <div class="label">Le principe</div>
      <h2>Jamais en contact<br>avec <em>le sol.</em></h2>
      <p>La chaussure EMPREINTE repose toujours sur une semelle modulable. Elle n'est jamais exposée à l'abrasion directe du terrain. C'est ce qui lui permet de durer 2 à 3 fois plus longtemps qu'une chaussure classique.</p>
      <p>Chaque composant a été sélectionné parmi les matériaux les plus performants du secteur : tissage Matryx utilisé dans l'équipement de montagne, mousse PEBA issue des chaussures de compétition, système de fixation inspiré du ski de fond.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-visual">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?w=900&q=85&fit=crop" alt="Chaussure EMPREINTE trail" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="intro-visual-tag">Base EMPREINTE — 120€</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- COMPOSANTS -->
  <section class="composants">
    <div class="composants-header">
      <h2>Trois composants.<br><em>Zéro compromis.</em></h2>
      <p>Chaque partie de la chaussure a été conçue pour répondre à une contrainte précise. Légèreté, durabilité, performance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="compo-grid">
      <div class="compo">
        <span class="compo-icon">🧵</span>
        <div class="compo-name">Matryx™</div>
        <div class="compo-zone">Tige / Mesh supérieur</div>
        <p class="compo-desc">Tissage hybride de fibres Kevlar et polyamide. Le même matériau utilisé dans les casques d'alpinisme et les équipements de montagne extrême. Indéchirable en toutes conditions, ultra-léger et naturellement hydrophobe — l'eau glisse sans pénétrer la chaussure.</p>
        <div class="compo-highlight">Résistance à la déchirure ×4 vs mesh standard</div>
      </div>
      <div class="compo">
        <span class="compo-icon">⚡</span>
        <div class="compo-name">PEBA</div>
        <div class="compo-zone">Semelle intermédiaire / Amorti</div>
        <p class="compo-desc">Mousse PEBA haute résilience, la même technologie que les chaussures à plaque carbone de compétition. Conserve 95% de son rebond initial jusqu'à 1 500 km. Contrairement à l'EVA standard qui s'écrase après 600 km, le PEBA maintient ses propriétés sur la durée.</p>
        <div class="compo-highlight">1 500 km vs 600 km pour une EVA standard</div>
      </div>
      <div class="compo">
        <span class="compo-icon">🔒</span>
        <div class="compo-name">Slide-Lock™</div>
        <div class="compo-zone">Système de fixation modulaire</div>
        <p class="compo-desc">Rails femelles en polymère rigide-flexible intégrés sous la chaussure. Loquet de sécurité au talon inspiré des fixations de ski de fond. Joint Seal-Lip en silicone sur tout le périmètre pour une étanchéité parfaite contre la boue et l'eau.</p>
        <div class="compo-highlight">Changement de semelle en moins de 10 secondes</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SPLIT MESH -->
  <div class="split">
    <div class="split-photo">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?w=900&q=85&fit=crop&crop=left" alt="Trail running" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="split-content dark">
      <div class="label">Tige — Mesh Matryx</div>
      <h3>Indéchirable.<br><em>Hydrophobe.</em><br>Ultra-léger.</h3>
      <p>Le Matryx est un tissage développé par Dyneema et Matryx pour les applications extrêmes. Chaque fibre de Kevlar est entrelacée avec du polyamide haute performance pour créer une structure qui résiste aux déchirures, aux pierres et aux branches.</p>
      <p>L'hydrophobicité naturelle du tissage signifie que la chaussure ne s'alourdit pas sous la pluie — l'eau glisse en surface et s'évacue immédiatement.</p>
      <div class="spec-list">
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Composition</span><span class="spec-v">Kevlar + Polyamide</span></div>
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Résistance</span><span class="spec-v">×4 vs mesh standard</span></div>
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Hydrophobicité</span><span class="spec-v">Naturelle — sans traitement</span></div>
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Poids tige</span><span class="spec-v">Allégé de 18% vs norme</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SPLIT PEBA -->
  <div class="split">
    <div class="split-content light">
      <div class="label">Semelle intermédiaire — PEBA</div>
      <h3>1 500 km.<br><em>95% de rebond</em><br>conservé.</h3>
      <p>La mousse PEBA (Polyether Block Amide) est la même technologie que celle des chaussures de marathon à plaque carbone haut de gamme. Contrairement à la mousse EVA standard, le PEBA ne se compacte pas avec le temps.</p>
      <p>À 1 500 km, une chaussure EMPREINTE conserve encore 95% de ses propriétés d'amorti. Une chaussure standard est considérée comme morte à 600 km.</p>
      <div class="spec-list">
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Matériau</span><span class="spec-v">PEBA haute résilience</span></div>
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Durée de vie</span><span class="spec-v">1 500 km (vs 600 km EVA)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Rebond à 1500km</span><span class="spec-v">95% conservé</span></div>
        <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-k">Énergie retournée</span><span class="spec-v">+12% vs EVA</span></div>
      </div>
